  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Conjuration sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you summon a Conjuration sphere companion, you may select any number of magic items occupying magic item slots on your body, losing the benefit of those magic items and applying them to the companion for the duration of the summon. Only one companion can benefit from this ability at one time; assigning the bonus to a newly summoned companion ends its effects for any previously summoned companion.</p>\n<p>You regain the benefits of the selected items when the summon ends. You still count as possessing the item for the purpose of items that require an attunement period. You may not assign cursed items to the companion.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/conjuration#toc124\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
